 "identifier": "kaal:claim:3396542-008",
 "text": "Because newly minted reward tokens go only to agents who stake tokens on policies, passive holders are diluted over time, which pushes agents toward active underwriting while still permitting passive investment.",
 "author": {
  "@type": "Person",
  "name": "Wulf A. Kaal",
